{
  "lessonId": "L1M1L3",
  "title": "義大利地理與氣候",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover'><h1>🗺️ 義大利地理與氣候</h1><p class='subtitle'>從阿爾卑斯山到西西里島的風土之旅</p></section><section class='slide italy-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='italy-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='italy-map' class='italy-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#667eea;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🗺️ 義大利產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(102,126,234,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #667eea'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>義大利20個產區，從阿爾卑斯山到西西里島的多樣風土</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #3498db;padding-bottom:8px'>🏔️ 北部產區（8個）</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(52,152,219,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #3498db'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#3498db;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#3498db'>Piemonte, Lombardy, Veneto</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>大陸性氣候，高酸度、優雅風格</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #27ae60;padding-bottom:8px'>🌿 中部產區（6個）</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(39,174,96,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #27ae60'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#27ae60;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#27ae60'>Toscana, Umbria, Marche</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>地中海氣候，結構平衡、風味複雜</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #e74c3c;padding-bottom:8px'>☀️ 南部產區（6個）</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(231,76,60,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e74c3c'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e74c3c;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e74c3c'>Puglia, Sicily, Campania</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>炎熱氣候，濃郁、酒精度高、果味豐富</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌍 義大利的地理優勢</h2><div class='stats-grid'><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>📏</div><div class='stat-number'>1,200</div><div class='stat-label'>公里南北長度</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🏔️</div><div class='stat-number'>35%</div><div class='stat-label'>山地</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🌄</div><div class='stat-number'>42%</div><div class='stat-label'>丘陵</div></div><div class='stat-card'><div class='stat-icon'>🌾</div><div class='stat-number'>23%</div><div class='stat-label'>平原</div></div></div><div class='highlight-box'><p><strong>地中海中心的葡萄酒王國</strong></p><p>狹長的半島地形，三面環海，造就了極其多樣化的風土條件</p></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌡️ 三大氣候帶</h2><div class='climate-zones'><div class='zone-card'><div class='zone-header north'>🏔️ 北部 - 大陸性氣候</div><div class='zone-body'><p><strong>產區：</strong>Piemonte, Lombardy, Veneto</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>冬冷夏熱，晝夜溫差大</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>高酸度、優雅、陳年潛力強</p><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Barolo, Amarone</p></div></div><div class='zone-card'><div class='zone-header central'>🌿 中部 - 地中海氣候</div><div class='zone-body'><p><strong>產區：</strong>Toscana, Umbria, Marche</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>溫暖乾燥夏季，溫和冬季</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>結構平衡、風味複雜</p><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Chianti, Brunello</p></div></div><div class='zone-card'><div class='zone-header south'>☀️ 南部 - 炎熱氣候</div><div class='zone-body'><p><strong>產區：</strong>Puglia, Sicily, Calabria</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>炎熱乾燥，日照充足</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>濃郁、酒精度高、果味豐富</p><p><strong>代表酒款：</strong>Primitivo, Nero d'Avola</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⛰️ 地形的影響</h2><div class='terrain-grid'><div class='terrain-item'><div class='terrain-icon'>🏔️</div><h3>阿爾卑斯山區</h3><p>海拔 200-500m 的山坡葡萄園</p><p>涼爽氣候 → 高酸度、優雅風格</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Nebbiolo, Pinot Noir</p></div><div class='terrain-item'><div class='terrain-icon'>🌄</div><h3>亞平寧丘陵</h3><p>托斯卡納經典產區</p><p>排水良好 → 濃縮風味</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Sangiovese, Trebbiano</p></div><div class='terrain-item'><div class='terrain-icon'>🏝️</div><h3>火山土壤</h3><p>Sicily Etna, Campania Vesuvius</p><p>礦物質豐富 → 獨特風味</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Nerello, Aglianico</p></div><div class='terrain-item'><div class='terrain-icon'>🌊</div><h3>海洋影響</div><p>Liguria, Sardegna 沿海產區</p><p>海風調節 → 清爽風格</p><p><strong>代表：</strong>Vermentino, Pigato</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 土壤類型多樣性</h2><div class='soil-types'><div class='soil-card'><div class='soil-name'>🪨 石灰岩 (Calcareous)</div><div class='soil-regions'>Piemonte (Barolo), Toscana</div><div class='soil-effect'>排水佳，賦予優雅與礦物感</div></div><div class='soil-card'><div class='soil-name'>🧱 黏土 (Clay)</div><div class='soil-regions'>Toscana (Chianti), Umbria</div><div class='soil-effect'>保水性好，葡萄飽滿有力</div></div><div class='soil-card'><div class='soil-name'>🌋 火山土 (Volcanic)</div><div class='soil-regions'>Sicily (Etna), Campania</div><div class='soil-effect'>礦物質豐富，風味獨特</div></div><div class='soil-card'><div class='soil-name'>⛰️ 砂岩 (Sandstone)</div><div class='soil-regions'>Veneto, Friuli</div><div class='soil-effect'>早熟，果香明顯</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點總結</h2><div class='key-takeaways'><div class='takeaway-item'>✓ 南北跨越 10 個緯度，氣候差異巨大</div><div class='takeaway-item'>✓ 丘陵地形最適合釀酒葡萄種植</div><div class='takeaway-item'>✓ 海拔、朝向、土壤共同決定風土</div><div class='takeaway-item'>✓ 北部優雅、中部平衡、南部濃郁</div></div><div class='map-prompt'><p>💡 <strong>建議：</strong>點擊「互動地圖」按鈕，探索義大利 20 個產區的地理分布！</p></div></section></div><style>.map-slide-container{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:30px;height:calc(100vh - 200px);min-height:500px;padding:20px}.italy-overview-map{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3);background:#1a1a2e}.map-legend{background:rgba(26,26,46,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:12px;padding:25px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);height:fit-content;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}.map-legend h3{margin:0 0 20px;color:#fff;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(102,126,234,.6);padding-bottom:10px}.legend-items{margin-bottom:25px}.legend-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;color:#fff;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:500}.legend-dot{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;box-shadow:0 0 8px currentColor;flex-shrink:0}.legend-dot.north{background:#3498db}.legend-dot.central{background:#27ae60}.legend-dot.south{background:#e74c3c}.map-tips{background:rgba(102,126,234,.15);border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-top:20px;border:1px solid rgba(102,126,234,.3)}.map-tips p{margin:0 0 10px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem}.map-tips ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.95);line-height:1.8}.map-tips li{list-style:none;padding-left:0;margin:5px 0;font-size:1rem;font-weight:500}.climate-zones{display:grid;gap:20px;margin:20px 0}.zone-card{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.zone-header{padding:15px;color:#fff;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center}.zone-header.north{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db,#2980b9)}.zone-header.central{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#27ae60,#229954)}.zone-header.south{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e74c3c,#c0392b)}.zone-body{background:#fff;padding:20px}.zone-body p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.6}.zone-body strong{color:#2c3e50}.terrain-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;margin:20px 0}.terrain-item{background:#f8f9fa;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:4px solid #667eea;text-align:center}.terrain-icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:10px}.terrain-item h3{font-size:1.2rem;color:#2c3e50;margin:10px 0}.terrain-item p{margin:8px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#555}.terrain-item strong{color:#667eea}.soil-types{display:grid;gap:15px;margin:20px 0}.soil-card{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8f9fa,#fff);padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #667eea;transition:all .3s}.soil-card:hover{transform:translateX(5px);box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.soil-name{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:8px}.soil-regions{color:#667eea;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:5px}.soil-effect{color:#555;font-style:italic}.key-takeaways{display:grid;gap:12px;margin:20px 0}.takeaway-item{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8f5e9,transparent);padding:18px 25px;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}.map-prompt{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff3e0,#ffe0b2);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;margin-top:20px;border:2px dashed #ff9800}.map-prompt p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem}</style>",
  "quiz": [
